# Normalise every text file to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, line endings depend on the machine: a checkout with
# core.autocrlf set produces CRLF working copies, and committing those
# produces CRLF blobs. The result is that the same file has different
# endings in different clones, and flipping one turns a one-line change into
# a whole-file diff.
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect binaries itself, so images and archives are
# left untouched; `eol=lf` forces LF for everything it recognises as text.
* text=auto eol=lf
